# Files NOT uploaded by gcloud. This file is shared by BOTH:
#   * `gcloud builds submit` (Task 3, image build) — needs the Dockerfile, so do NOT
#     exclude Dockerfile/.dockerignore here.
#   * `gcloud functions deploy` (Task 6) — gen2 + --runtime uses buildpacks, so the
#     Dockerfile is simply ignored there; leaving it in the source is harmless.
# Keeping this list to test/docs/scratch files makes both commands' contexts lean.
tests/
ci/
measure.py
__pycache__/
.venv/
submission/
README.md
TASKS.md
